      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont know what is happening but everything is getting so loud and weird. like i can literally hear the electricity humming in the walls of my apartment and it sounds like deep music lol. and tonight i was laying on the couch and could actually see this glowing orange warmth coming off my cat even though the lights were off. is this like... part of some kind of human evolution thing? like a sensory upgrade or something? its kinda overwhelming",
